      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Rogan will talk briefly about the &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.owasp.org/&#34;&gt;Open Web Application Security Project (OWASP)&lt;/a&gt;, then introduce, explain and demonstrate &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.owasp.org/index.php/OWASP_WebScarab_NG_Project&#34;&gt;OWASP&amp;#39;s WebScarab-NG testing tool&lt;/a&gt;.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </abstract>
